{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21038","headline":"感讽六首 一 · 李贺","name":"感讽六首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人间春荡荡，帐暖香扬扬。\n飞光染幽红，夸娇来洞房。\n舞席泥金蛇，桐竹罗花牀。\n眼逐春瞑醉，粉随泪色黄。\n王子下马来，曲沼鸣鸳鸯。\n焉知肠车转，一夕巡九方。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21038.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21038","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"周啸天"}